<!doctype html>
<html lang="en"><head><meta charset="utf-8"><meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1">
<title>{{ result.metadata.strategy.name }} · QuantLab report</title>
<style>
:root{color-scheme:light;--ink:#203641;--muted:#64757c;--paper:#f4f3ee;--accent:#166c69}*{box-sizing:border-box}body{margin:0;background:var(--paper);color:var(--ink);font:15px/1.65 system-ui,-apple-system,sans-serif}main{max-width:1240px;margin:0 auto;padding:48px 30px 80px}header{border-top:5px solid var(--accent);padding-top:24px;margin-bottom:30px}.eyebrow{font-size:12px;letter-spacing:.2em;text-transform:uppercase;color:var(--accent)}h1{font-size:38px;line-height:1.2;margin:16px 0}h2{font-size:23px;margin:40px 0 16px}p{color:var(--muted)}.badge{display:inline-block;background:#e3ece8;padding:6px 12px;border-radius:4px;font-size:13px}.source{padding:16px 20px;background:#fff1d9;border-left:4px solid #b77628}.metrics{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(4,1fr);gap:12px}.metric{background:white;padding:18px;border:1px solid #dce2df;border-radius:8px;min-width:0}.label{color:var(--muted);font-size:12px;overflow-wrap:anywhere}.value{font-size:25px;margin-top:7px;font-variant-numeric:tabular-nums}.charts{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(2,minmax(0,1fr));gap:18px}.chart{background:white;border:1px solid #dce2df;border-radius:8px;padding:12px}.chart img{display:block;width:100%;height:auto}table{width:100%;border-collapse:collapse;font-size:13px;background:white}th,td{text-align:left;border-bottom:1px solid #e2e6e3;padding:10px 14px;vertical-align:top}th{color:var(--accent);font-weight:600}td{overflow-wrap:anywhere}summary{cursor:pointer;font-weight:600}.table-scroll{overflow-x:auto}pre{background:#203641;color:#eef4ef;padding:20px;white-space:pre-wrap;overflow-wrap:anywhere;border-radius:8px}.warnings{background:#fff;padding:20px 28px;border-left:4px solid #b77628}.foot{margin-top:40px;font-size:12px}a{color:var(--accent)}@media(max-width:800px){main{padding:24px 16px}.metrics{grid-template-columns:repeat(2,1fr)}.charts{grid-template-columns:1fr}h1{font-size:28px}}@media print{main{max-width:none}.chart,.metric{break-inside:avoid}details{display:block}}
</style></head><body><main>
<header><div class="eyebrow">QuantLab / Daily equity research</div><h1>{{ result.metadata.strategy.name }}</h1><span class="badge">{{ summary['Start / End'] }} · {{ summary['Price Policy'] }} · next open</span><p>{{ summary['Run ID'] }}</p></header>
<div class="source"><strong>Data provenance</strong><br>{{ audit['Data source'] }}. Research report; not investment advice.</div>
<h2>Performance &amp; risk</h2><div class="metrics">{% for key,value in metrics %}<div class="metric"><div class="label">{{ key }}</div><div class="value">{{ value }}</div></div>{% endfor %}</div>
<p>Undefined ratios are N/A. First session close is the baseline; return statistics exclude its synthetic zero return. No round-trip win rate is inferred.</p>
<h2>Run summary</h2><table>{% for key,value in summary.items() %}<tr><th>{{ key }}</th><td>{{ value }}</td></tr>{% endfor %}</table>
<h2>Research charts</h2><div class="charts">{% for chart in charts %}<div class="chart"><img src="{{ chart.src }}" alt="{{ chart.title }}"></div>{% endfor %}</div>
<h2>Drawdown episode</h2><table>{% for key,value in result.metadata.drawdown_details.items() %}<tr><th>{{ key }}</th><td>{{ value if value is not none else 'N/A / not recovered' }}</td></tr>{% endfor %}</table>
<h2>Audit assumptions</h2><table>{% for key,value in audit.items() %}<tr><th>{{ key }}</th><td>{{ value }}</td></tr>{% endfor %}</table>
<h2>Warnings &amp; execution exceptions</h2><div class="warnings"><ul>{% for warning in result.warnings %}<li>{{ warning }}</li>{% endfor %}</ul></div>
<h2>Order audit</h2><p>First 500 orders shown. Complete records: orders.csv / fills.csv / positions.parquet in this archive.</p><div class="table-scroll"><table><thead><tr>{% for col in order_columns %}<th>{{ col }}</th>{% endfor %}</tr></thead><tbody>{% for row in orders %}<tr>{% for col in order_columns %}<td>{{ row[col] }}</td>{% endfor %}</tr>{% endfor %}</tbody></table></div>
<h2>Reproduce this experiment</h2><p>The command uses the frozen strategy and data snapshot. Match the saved engine source and package versions before comparing across environments.</p><pre>{{ reproduction_command }}</pre>
<details><summary>Metric definitions</summary><table>{% for key,value in result.metadata.metric_definitions.items() %}<tr><th>{{ key }}</th><td>{{ value }}</td></tr>{% endfor %}</table></details>
<p class="foot">US Equity Quant Lab · Auditable local research · {{ result.metadata.data_fingerprint }}</p>
</main></body></html>
